{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"fsharp","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"F#","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for F# (.fs .fsx .fsi).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"fsharp","name":"F#","extensions":[".fs",".fsx",".fsi"],"grammar":"grammars/fsharp.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["(*","*)"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"F#","path":"snippets/fsharp.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/fsharp.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\(\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\|>|<\\\\||->|<-|>>=|::\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:exception|interface|namespace|abstract|delegate|downcast|function|internal|override|default|finally|inherit|mutable|private|assert|downto|extern|global|inline|member|module|public|return|static|struct|upcast|begin|class|fixed|match|while|yield|base|done|elif|else|lazy|null|open|then|type|void|when|with|and|end|for|fun|let|new|rec|sig|try|use|val|as|do|if|in|of|or|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:double|string|option|Result|int64|float|array|bool|char|byte|unit|list|int|seq|Map|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:failwith|printfn|sprintf|printf|ignore|fst|snd|id)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/fsharp.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let ${1:name} ${2:x} =\",\n      \"    $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Record\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:Name} = { ${2:Field}: ${3:string} }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A record\"\n  },\n  \"Union\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"du\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:Shape} =\",\n      \"    | ${2:Circle} of float\",\n      \"    | ${3:Square} of float\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A discriminated union\"\n  },\n  \"Match\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"match\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"match ${1:x} with\",\n      \"| ${2:pattern} -> $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"match\"\n  },\n  \"Entry point\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[<EntryPoint>]\",\n      \"let main argv =\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"    0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The entry point\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# F#\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for F#.\n\n## Files\n\n`.fs`, `.fsx`, `.fsi`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `let` | A function |\n| `rec` | A record |\n| `du` | A discriminated union |\n| `match` | match |\n| `main` | The entry point |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}